            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Respondent, the Steelworker trilogy standard for labor arbitration does not apply under the Railway Labor Act."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Ballenger",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "f7c5ac7d273cf5b4f22d4217d2d8c5c4cd80379f782675713b0042bb656151b1",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-f7c5ac7d273c-0001-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 22,
                "start": 22
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Ballenger, evidence of conferencing is essential to the board\u2019s consideration of disputes, as established in Award\u202f18679 and other precedent."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Thomas H. Geoghegan",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "f7c5ac7d273cf5b4f22d4217d2d8c5c4cd80379f782675713b0042bb656151b1",
